.TH XWAYLAND-SATELLITE 1 "July 2026" "y5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xwayland\-satellite \- rootless Xwayland integration for Wayland compositors (y5 build)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xwayland\-satellite
.RI [ DISPLAY ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xwayland\-satellite
grants rootless Xwayland integration to Wayland compositors that do not
manage X11 clients themselves. It runs
.BR Xwayland (1)
on the given
.I DISPLAY
(for example \fB:12\fR) and maps X11 windows to Wayland surfaces.
.PP
This build carries y5-specific popup-scale fixes and is normally
started by the
.I xwayland.service
systemd user unit bound to the compositor session.
.SH OPTIONS
This build accepts, among others:
.TP
.BI \-\-force\-scale " FACTOR"
Report a fixed scale factor to X11 clients.
.TP
.B \-\-ignore\-fractional\-scale
Ignore fractional scaling reported by the compositor.
.TP
.B \-\-popup\-fix
Enable the y5 popup positioning/scale fixes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR y5.compositor (1),
.BR Xwayland (1)
